{
    "about": "A rich board label's lines and the runs each is read as: [text, bold, code]. The canvas (resources/js/features/boards/drawing/labels.ts, runsOf) and the server (App\\Support\\Board\\LabelFit::runs) must read each the same; labels.test.ts and tests/Unit/LabelFitTest.php both check every case here.",
